      "value": "Output is a raw dump of 12 L2-floor values (~6.32455e-12) with no context: no time/step labels, no baseline/comparison, no statement of what hypothesis is being tested, and no inference. Cannot verify against iter 9's claim about SSFM Δt=1e-4, N=1024 because no method/parameters are attached to these numbers. The values are internally consistent (flat to ~1e-17) but unsupported as evidence for any conclusion."
